      "locked": false,
      "text": "Uni-v4 hook:\n- tax and distribution depending on\npremium\n- Floor price support in the pool\n- if a sale is big - the vault $MONO to\npeg the floor",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "D8YRKkkPlL1OF7b2h6A8J",
      "originalText": "Uni-v4 hook:\n- tax and distribution depending on premium\n- Floor price support in the pool\n- if a sale is big - the vault $MONO to peg the floor",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
